WEBVTT

00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:06.110
The sky is beautiful.

00:00:06.430 --> 00:00:10.530
Looking down on people from a 
high place just relaxes you.

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:15.610
I'm sure my blood, the Noya 
blood within me desires that.

00:00:15.940 --> 00:00:17.370
That's not true.

00:00:17.370 --> 00:00:18.280
What?

00:00:18.610 --> 00:00:23.310
The Itsuki-sama I know said 
something very different.

00:00:23.850 --> 00:00:26.810
He said that the sky 
doesn't belong to anyone.

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:29.110
That's why he liked it.

00:00:29.110 --> 00:00:31.550
That's only what the 
former me had said.

00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:35.420
The only thing you 
need to do is obey me,

00:00:35.420 --> 00:00:37.010
obey the person I am now.

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:42.360
Yes, Itsuki-sama.

00:00:42.870 --> 00:00:46.690
Now is the time for me 
to release my power.

00:00:46.690 --> 00:00:50.270
Now let us go forth and 
build my ideal world!

00:02:45.660 --> 00:02:51.150
<i>The true Noya Itsuki 
has finally appeared.</i>

00:02:52.440 --> 00:02:54.810
<i>Using his powerful pheromones,</i>

00:02:54.810 --> 00:02:57.450
<i>girls—one after the other—fall 
under his control.</i>

00:02:59.150 --> 00:03:02.710
<i>And the only method of returning 
him to his former self,</i>

00:03:02.280 --> 00:03:06.290
<b>Pheromone Breaker (Name subject to change)</b>

00:03:02.710 --> 00:03:06.290
<i>the Pheromone Breaker (Name subject 
to change), has been taken...</i>

00:03:07.140 --> 00:03:08.770
<i>The Astronomy Club is now facing one of</i>

00:03:08.770 --> 00:03:10.280
<i>the greatest challenges 
in human history.</i>

00:03:12.740 --> 00:03:15.770
<i>Kyouko and the others chase 
after Itsuki and Izumiko,</i>

00:03:15.770 --> 00:03:17.440
<i>who headed towards an amusement park.</i>

00:03:18.300 --> 00:03:22.300
<i>Meanwhile, around the same 
time, Ooba and Iseda...</i>

00:03:32.650 --> 00:03:36.110
Hasumi, you're the only one

00:03:36.110 --> 00:03:40.930
who's taken me seriously 
this whole anime...

00:03:46.020 --> 00:03:49.600
"B" anime can surpass the 
ranks of the elite anime

00:03:49.600 --> 00:03:51.420
if the people who make them work hard.

00:03:52.710 --> 00:03:55.420
Hasumi, I'm not really 
sure what happened,

00:03:55.420 --> 00:03:58.000
but I gathered these seven 
balls and came back to life!

00:03:59.480 --> 00:04:02.350
Change!

00:04:06.630 --> 00:04:07.760
Ribbit.

00:04:08.190 --> 00:04:11.270
I can only pity Iseda-san, 
thinking about how

00:04:11.720 --> 00:04:13.360
she will live from this point on.

00:04:13.360 --> 00:04:14.250
Ribbit.

00:04:15.550 --> 00:04:18.540
<i>Kyouko and the others 
race towards Itsuki.</i>

00:04:19.670 --> 00:04:23.540
<i>The final battle was about to begin.</i>

00:04:24.840 --> 00:04:33.830
<b>The Astronomy Club's Great Victory!</b>

00:04:24.840 --> 00:04:33.830
<b>Ready, Go Towards Tomorrow!!</b>

00:04:35.800 --> 00:04:38.210
So you've come, Kyouko-san.

00:04:38.690 --> 00:04:40.990
How about you hand Izumiko over?

00:04:40.990 --> 00:04:42.670
Neko-sensei, too!

00:04:42.670 --> 00:04:44.630
You guys don't give up, do you?

00:04:45.150 --> 00:04:49.750
What are you planning bringing 
all of these young girls here?

00:04:49.750 --> 00:04:51.160
Isn't it obvious?

00:04:51.160 --> 00:04:52.580
Using this power of mine,

00:04:52.580 --> 00:04:55.850
I plan to make a harem full of children.

00:04:57.170 --> 00:04:58.440
Then I shall ask you this...

00:04:58.880 --> 00:04:59.980
Why?

00:05:01.420 --> 00:05:03.740
Heh, you know why.

00:05:04.610 --> 00:05:06.200
Jump!

00:05:07.530 --> 00:05:10.330
It's because, I'm a lolicon!

00:05:13.510 --> 00:05:15.080
Everyone, get back!

00:05:15.390 --> 00:05:18.020
It's dangerous to let 
him get any closer!

00:05:19.690 --> 00:05:24.800
You're rather courageous 
for facing me one-on-one.

00:05:25.400 --> 00:05:27.510
I wouldn't expect less 
from my future bride.

00:05:28.030 --> 00:05:29.050
That's right...

00:05:29.860 --> 00:05:32.900
Onee-sama and Itsuki-sama 
are engaged to each other.

00:05:34.130 --> 00:05:36.780
No matter how much I serve Itsuki-sama,

00:05:37.320 --> 00:05:38.880
he will not understand how I feel...

00:05:40.320 --> 00:05:43.170
No matter how much I 
care for Itsuki-sama,

00:05:43.170 --> 00:05:45.250
he will return to my sister's side.

00:05:45.940 --> 00:05:49.450
Everything I care about 
belongs to my sister.

00:05:49.450 --> 00:05:52.900
Hmph. You're actually afraid, aren't you?

00:05:53.890 --> 00:05:56.870
If you really cared, I'm sure 
you could have forcefully

00:05:56.870 --> 00:05:59.520
taken control of me in the 
classroom not too long ago.

00:06:01.640 --> 00:06:04.570
But you didn't do that, and 
that's because you're actually

00:06:04.570 --> 00:06:07.450
afraid of the blood flowing 
through us Todayama, am I wrong?

00:06:07.450 --> 00:06:09.390
What is she talking about?

00:06:09.390 --> 00:06:12.950
Yes, but every person in your clan agrees

00:06:12.950 --> 00:06:14.990
that's nothing more than a mythical story...

00:06:14.990 --> 00:06:17.050
Every person but one, that is!

00:06:17.050 --> 00:06:21.400
Even you cannot defeat me one-on-one 
if I get serious here.

00:06:22.150 --> 00:06:23.780
That may be true,

00:06:23.780 --> 00:06:27.310
but you've made a mistake 
about one other thing.

00:06:27.670 --> 00:06:30.780
Do you think that this is my true form?

00:06:30.780 --> 00:06:31.990
What?!

00:06:31.990 --> 00:06:37.170
Very well, I shall force you into 
despair now, rather than later.

00:06:37.170 --> 00:06:39.750
The most absolute despair.

00:06:41.220 --> 00:06:45.840
Every time I transform, my pheromones 
increase exponentially.

00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:46.510
What did...

00:06:46.510 --> 00:06:49.230
Huh? What did Noya-kun say?

00:06:49.230 --> 00:06:51.010
Noya's going to transform again?

00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:53.180
Itsuki-sama, you can't!

00:06:56.060 --> 00:06:57.430
This is your fault, Onee-sama.

00:06:57.870 --> 00:07:00.380
You've left him no other choice!

00:07:01.010 --> 00:07:02.870
It would be simple for me

00:07:02.870 --> 00:07:04.600
to turn all of you into my servants,

00:07:04.600 --> 00:07:07.440
even with this form alone, but...

00:07:09.310 --> 00:07:11.740
I'll give you guys a little show!

00:07:11.740 --> 00:07:13.950
Witness my final form,

00:07:14.340 --> 00:07:16.290
my true form!

00:07:29.500 --> 00:07:31.320
<i>I'm sorry, Itsuki-sama.</i>

00:07:32.200 --> 00:07:34.190
<i>I promised that I would protect you,</i>

00:07:34.190 --> 00:07:35.720
<i>always standing beside you...</i>

00:07:36.820 --> 00:07:39.860
<i>But maybe there's really 
been no reason for me</i>

00:07:39.860 --> 00:07:41.310
<i>to stand at your side, after all.</i>

00:07:41.910 --> 00:07:43.310
Look at that!

00:07:47.320 --> 00:07:52.450
Nuko!

00:07:48.660 --> 00:07:52.070
<i>Itsuki-sama's pheromones 
are calling forth cats.</i>

00:07:55.880 --> 00:07:57.700
Wh-What's happening?

00:07:57.700 --> 00:08:00.080
I don't know, but I'm jealous.

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:01.830
Jealous in a cat way.

00:08:17.000 --> 00:08:18.390
The dust's clearing!

00:08:35.000 --> 00:08:36.180
Itsuki-sama...

00:08:51.260 --> 00:08:53.980
Huh? That's the real Noya-kun?

00:08:53.980 --> 00:08:56.010
He's gotten bigger and more attractive.

00:08:56.240 --> 00:08:58.290
Well there's a good example of why one

00:08:58.290 --> 00:08:59.950
shouldn't trust a book by its cover.

00:09:00.400 --> 00:09:02.630
He was cuter before, anyway.

00:09:03.680 --> 00:09:06.290
Now I guess it's about time

00:09:06.290 --> 00:09:09.060
to have you participate 
in my little plan.

00:09:09.340 --> 00:09:11.700
Izumiko, give it to me.

00:09:11.700 --> 00:09:13.410
Y-Yes.

00:09:24.050 --> 00:09:24.830
What?

00:09:27.360 --> 00:09:29.370
I-I can't...

00:09:29.370 --> 00:09:30.720
...move.

00:09:31.960 --> 00:09:35.070
No one can resist me 
when I'm in this form.

00:09:38.720 --> 00:09:39.760
Gulp.

00:09:42.110 --> 00:09:43.820
Huh?

00:09:44.420 --> 00:09:45.770
What?!

00:09:46.710 --> 00:09:48.520
Why did Kanamori get smaller?

00:09:49.810 --> 00:09:50.780
Next!

00:09:52.200 --> 00:09:53.190
Out of the way!

00:10:00.130 --> 00:10:01.780
Not Todayama-san, too!

00:10:04.370 --> 00:10:05.980
Wonderful!

00:10:05.980 --> 00:10:09.290
Izumiko, ready maid outfits for them.

00:10:09.290 --> 00:10:12.000
I shall have them serve 
me as my personal maids.

00:10:14.450 --> 00:10:15.590
Understood.

00:10:15.850 --> 00:10:17.840
Stop it, Izumiko!

00:10:19.780 --> 00:10:23.720
Itsuki-sama became weird after 
meeting you, Onee-sama.

00:10:24.280 --> 00:10:26.480
This is all your fault.

00:10:26.680 --> 00:10:28.290
Wait right there!

00:10:28.290 --> 00:10:29.170
Jump!

00:10:33.920 --> 00:10:36.280
Sensei, where have you 
been this whole time?

00:10:36.540 --> 00:10:37.640
Wait, you haven't been sitting around

00:10:37.640 --> 00:10:39.070
in the student council room 
since last episode, have you?

00:10:39.070 --> 00:10:42.990
No, all has been done according 
to my darling's instructions!

00:10:42.990 --> 00:10:45.590
Don't interrupt when things 
were just getting good!

00:10:46.470 --> 00:10:47.540
Gulp.

00:10:47.540 --> 00:10:48.690
She swallowed it.

00:10:48.690 --> 00:10:50.080
She's going to turn into a child, too?

00:10:54.150 --> 00:10:55.140
What?!

00:10:55.140 --> 00:10:56.340
She's not changing?

00:10:58.410 --> 00:11:00.630
We should withdraw and regroup for now.

00:11:01.220 --> 00:11:03.140
Damn it! We have no place we can hide!

00:11:03.140 --> 00:11:04.930
Being in a deserted place is going 
to work at a disadvantage for us!

00:11:04.930 --> 00:11:06.540
Hiromatsu, Oomori-sensei!

00:11:06.540 --> 00:11:07.800
Got it.

00:11:12.730 --> 00:11:15.310
My panties!

00:11:15.310 --> 00:11:18.220
Well, well, we're playing 
hide-and-seek now?

00:11:18.220 --> 00:11:22.950
Very well, tracking down one's 
prey is exciting, as well.

00:11:35.350 --> 00:11:37.900
Oomori-sensei, why are you here?

00:11:37.900 --> 00:11:40.150
Like I told you, I've been following

00:11:40.150 --> 00:11:42.660
my darling's instructions up until now.

00:11:42.660 --> 00:11:44.240
My clothes are falling off...

00:11:44.240 --> 00:11:47.720
Yeah, but why did something 
so wonderful have to happen?

00:11:47.720 --> 00:11:50.520
Wonderful? That drug from 
before did this to us.

00:11:50.520 --> 00:11:52.480
That drug is excellent.

00:11:52.480 --> 00:11:56.030
Are you a lolicon, too, Hiromatsu-san?

00:11:56.030 --> 00:11:59.100
Small things are cute. 
Nothing more than that.

00:11:59.100 --> 00:12:02.490
But why didn't it work 
on Oomori-sensei?

00:12:02.490 --> 00:12:06.410
Hehe, that's because of 
my darling's love for me!

00:12:06.410 --> 00:12:07.630
How about I tell you the

00:12:07.630 --> 00:12:09.700
legend of how him and I 
love each other so much?

00:12:09.700 --> 00:12:11.580
Time to ignore her.

00:12:12.220 --> 00:12:13.580
That drug...

00:12:13.830 --> 00:12:14.860
Drug?

00:12:14.860 --> 00:12:16.460
What we ended up taking was a drug

00:12:16.460 --> 00:12:18.640
that drastically decreases 
the amount of

00:12:18.640 --> 00:12:20.840
hormone that somatotropic cells produce.

00:12:21.370 --> 00:12:23.660
Izumiko used the drug 
in order to prevent

00:12:23.660 --> 00:12:25.660
the true Noya from manifesting.

00:12:25.660 --> 00:12:27.970
It was originally created

00:12:27.970 --> 00:12:30.580
to stop Noya Itsuki's rapid development,

00:12:31.360 --> 00:12:34.550
but the reason we shrunk 
when we took it is

00:12:34.550 --> 00:12:36.430
not just because of the drug's potency,

00:12:36.430 --> 00:12:38.730
but also probably the 
Vandenbergh effect.

00:12:39.380 --> 00:12:41.210
If there's a drug that 
will shrink someone,

00:12:41.210 --> 00:12:43.720
then there probably is one 
that will enlarge them.

00:12:43.720 --> 00:12:45.750
If I could analyze the arrangement 
of the stars closely,

00:12:45.750 --> 00:12:47.070
I should be able to figure it out...

00:12:47.680 --> 00:12:49.790
The stars?

00:12:49.790 --> 00:12:51.600
Yes, if I can check the 
position of the stars,

00:12:51.600 --> 00:12:53.210
I should be able to figure 
out how to make it.

00:12:54.170 --> 00:12:57.060
This old lady used to teach me how

00:12:57.060 --> 00:12:59.000
to make incense in a rose garden.

00:12:59.760 --> 00:13:02.630
She told me to use the 
stars as a code to help me remember

00:13:03.010 --> 00:13:06.640
how to make different 
scents and different medicines.

00:13:06.640 --> 00:13:07.390
Wait...

00:13:09.940 --> 00:13:11.730
That couldn't be...

00:13:11.730 --> 00:13:14.280
But we don't have enough time

00:13:14.280 --> 00:13:16.080
to get back and try to make a drug.

00:13:16.080 --> 00:13:17.730
But there's no other way to...

00:13:20.030 --> 00:13:21.750
I-I can't move...

00:13:21.750 --> 00:13:22.860
Why is...

00:13:23.810 --> 00:13:24.910
We've been looking for you.

00:13:33.260 --> 00:13:36.220
Now follow my orders, 
wear these clothes,

00:13:36.220 --> 00:13:38.380
and become my maids.

00:13:38.670 --> 00:13:40.130
I've been waiting for this moment!

00:13:41.150 --> 00:13:42.230
This voice...

00:13:42.690 --> 00:13:44.380
Darling!

00:13:56.670 --> 00:13:57.900
He's from when we...

00:14:03.430 --> 00:14:04.340
Nii-san!

00:14:05.020 --> 00:14:06.200
Darling!

00:14:06.200 --> 00:14:06.820
Itsuki-sama?

00:14:07.280 --> 00:14:08.870
We can move!

00:14:08.870 --> 00:14:09.930
Let's get out of here.

00:14:11.060 --> 00:14:13.830
Sorry I got all of you 
involved in this, as well.

00:14:14.460 --> 00:14:16.030
I will bear Itsuki's sins, as I have the

00:14:16.030 --> 00:14:17.370
same blood running through me!

00:14:17.370 --> 00:14:18.680
Ridiculous.

00:14:18.680 --> 00:14:22.510
You only have half-Noya 
blood running through you.

00:14:22.510 --> 00:14:23.930
Are you planning on taking revenge

00:14:23.930 --> 00:14:25.590
because you were unable 
to inherit this power,

00:14:25.590 --> 00:14:26.800
even though you were the eldest son?

00:14:27.100 --> 00:14:30.150
Itsuki, the only thing I 
wish to do is free you

00:14:30.150 --> 00:14:32.770
from the Noya family curse of 
only being able to show you

00:14:32.770 --> 00:14:34.220
care about people by ruling over them!

00:14:34.600 --> 00:14:38.420
Oomori-sensei's boyfriend 
and Noya-kun are brothers?!

00:14:39.150 --> 00:14:41.980
Nii-san, lolis are what 
dreams are made out of.

00:14:41.980 --> 00:14:44.230
Itsuki, big-breasted girls 
is what true love is.

00:14:46.220 --> 00:14:48.980
Lolicons versus boob lovers, eh?

00:14:50.490 --> 00:14:52.480
If you take that, 
you'll return to normal.

00:14:53.240 --> 00:14:55.520
You sure we can take this?

00:14:55.520 --> 00:14:57.010
It'll be fine.

00:14:57.010 --> 00:14:58.860
Oomori-sensei has 
already shown that the

00:14:58.860 --> 00:15:00.110
medicine works just fine.

00:15:00.110 --> 00:15:02.300
You mean he tested it on her?

00:15:02.300 --> 00:15:03.350
That wasn't it!

00:15:03.350 --> 00:15:05.900
Darling was just worried about me,

00:15:05.900 --> 00:15:08.570
and so he did so many different 
things to my body...

00:15:08.570 --> 00:15:09.840
No!

00:15:13.060 --> 00:15:13.880
What?

00:15:13.880 --> 00:15:15.140
That's not good!

00:15:15.450 --> 00:15:18.430
Sorry, but something came 
up, and I have to go.

00:15:18.720 --> 00:15:20.090
Stop Itsuki for me!

00:15:22.420 --> 00:15:24.060
That's all I wish.

00:15:24.060 --> 00:15:25.960
Let's go, Rei! Ready!

00:15:26.680 --> 00:15:27.630
Darling!

00:15:27.630 --> 00:15:29.020
Wait!

00:15:29.520 --> 00:15:31.350
They're gone...

00:15:31.350 --> 00:15:33.170
What did they even come here for?

00:15:33.890 --> 00:15:36.180
We had some annoyances 
for a moment there,

00:15:36.180 --> 00:15:37.950
but let us resume my little plan.

00:15:38.620 --> 00:15:41.690
Turning you into children didn't 
go as well as I had hoped,

00:15:41.690 --> 00:15:43.290
but I think I can add you to my harem,

00:15:43.290 --> 00:15:44.960
even if you're not... smaller.

00:15:45.260 --> 00:15:46.630
Large breasts,

00:15:46.990 --> 00:15:48.340
small breasts,

00:15:48.690 --> 00:15:49.840
a maid...

00:15:50.540 --> 00:15:53.600
And our mature woman...

00:15:53.600 --> 00:15:55.430
Who are you calling "mature?!"

00:15:57.170 --> 00:16:00.680
You can't go trying to 
resist me, Ooba-senpai.

00:16:01.280 --> 00:16:03.400
I think you need a little punishment.

00:16:06.960 --> 00:16:08.360
Vice-President!

00:16:08.630 --> 00:16:09.600
This isn't good...

00:16:09.600 --> 00:16:11.760
The pheromones were so strong 
she lost consciousness.

00:16:11.760 --> 00:16:12.750
That can't be!

00:16:12.750 --> 00:16:14.660
She didn't have her earplugs in?

00:16:14.660 --> 00:16:16.410
Run away, everyone!

00:16:16.410 --> 00:16:17.540
But...

00:16:17.540 --> 00:16:18.780
Get out of here now!

00:16:18.780 --> 00:16:19.860
You're in the way!

00:16:19.860 --> 00:16:21.460
Do all of you want to die here?

00:16:22.080 --> 00:16:25.380
Sorry for always entrusting our 
fate to you, and you alone.

00:16:25.710 --> 00:16:27.940
Don't die, my friend.

00:16:29.630 --> 00:16:31.630
Carry. Carry. Carry.

00:16:31.630 --> 00:16:35.260
Do you think you can run 
from me, my servants?

00:16:35.260 --> 00:16:38.640
I was able to come back to life by 
collecting these big seven balls.

00:16:38.640 --> 00:16:40.540
Huh? Where is everyone?

00:16:41.270 --> 00:16:43.270
Stop it, Noya!

00:16:52.160 --> 00:16:52.990
Huh?

00:16:52.990 --> 00:16:54.720
Oh? I guess I missed.

00:16:55.380 --> 00:16:57.370
I won't forgive you for that...

00:16:57.370 --> 00:16:59.990
President Iseda has died twice!

00:17:00.360 --> 00:17:02.010
She won't come back to life again!

00:17:02.060 --> 00:17:02.860
<b>Snap</b>

00:17:03.920 --> 00:17:06.040
I will never forgive you!

00:17:06.040 --> 00:17:09.920
Now I'm mad, Noya.

00:17:11.150 --> 00:17:13.600
What's going on? 
Onee-sama's transforming?

00:17:13.600 --> 00:17:14.500
Oh?

00:17:18.090 --> 00:17:20.470
Just what magic are you using,

00:17:20.470 --> 00:17:22.760
being able to withstand my pheromones?

00:17:24.880 --> 00:17:28.680
Unfortunately for you, 
I was not using my full power.

00:17:28.680 --> 00:17:30.570
That was only seventy percent.

00:17:30.570 --> 00:17:32.530
Wh-What was that?

00:17:37.530 --> 00:17:38.780
Eighty-five.

00:17:39.560 --> 00:17:40.740
Ninety...

00:17:40.740 --> 00:17:43.200
If you want to run, now is 
your chance, Onee-sama.

00:17:43.440 --> 00:17:45.420
No, this is a good chance.

00:17:45.420 --> 00:17:47.900
How about you show me the real 
power of the Noya family,

00:17:47.900 --> 00:17:49.280
the ones who will rule this planet?

00:17:50.100 --> 00:17:52.970
If I can withstand a blast 
from Noya at full power,

00:17:52.970 --> 00:17:55.220
I can finish my research.

00:17:55.950 --> 00:17:57.760
What do you mean?

00:17:58.310 --> 00:18:00.280
For that is my destiny.

00:18:00.820 --> 00:18:03.160
The Noya Financial Group, 
when they were first emerging,

00:18:03.160 --> 00:18:05.570
were after the Todayama 
family's scents,

00:18:05.570 --> 00:18:08.910
as we were a family with 
a long history in incense.

00:18:08.910 --> 00:18:12.730
Because of that I was forced 
to become his fiancée.

00:18:13.000 --> 00:18:18.340
Kyouko-san, I transferred to 
this school just to find you.

00:18:18.340 --> 00:18:20.280
I didn't know...

00:18:20.280 --> 00:18:23.370
It's because the other 
"me" wasn't aware of it.

00:18:24.580 --> 00:18:27.890
After that, in order to resurrect 
the Todayama family,

00:18:27.890 --> 00:18:31.090
and also to get away from being 
controlled by the Noya family,

00:18:31.090 --> 00:18:34.090
I threw away everything and 
immersed myself in my research.

00:18:36.230 --> 00:18:38.180
<i>I didn't know... I...</i>

00:18:45.250 --> 00:18:49.010
<i>That's what Onee-sama was 
thinking this whole time...</i>

00:18:50.150 --> 00:18:52.910
My one miscalculation 
was you, Noya Itsuki.

00:18:52.910 --> 00:18:57.700
After I left, before I knew it, 
you had gotten to know Izumiko.

00:18:58.590 --> 00:19:01.720
I left the family in order 
to escape Noya rule,

00:19:02.210 --> 00:19:05.160
but then my precious little sister 
was made into their maid.

00:19:05.160 --> 00:19:09.620
But so long as I live, 
I will not give you my sister.

00:19:09.930 --> 00:19:11.500
I will take her back!

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:14.300
Onee-sama, stop!

00:19:14.300 --> 00:19:15.380
Please just run...!

00:19:16.910 --> 00:19:18.090
Izumiko!

00:19:18.090 --> 00:19:19.800
Thank you for waiting.

00:19:20.080 --> 00:19:22.400
This is me at full power, 
as you so wished!

00:19:29.880 --> 00:19:30.670
Stop it...

00:19:31.270 --> 00:19:33.360
Please stop it, you two...

00:19:34.560 --> 00:19:36.790
I guess I'll ask you, just in case.

00:19:36.790 --> 00:19:37.980
How about it?

00:19:37.980 --> 00:19:40.020
You stay quiet, marry me, and call

00:19:40.020 --> 00:19:42.200
yourself Noya Kyouko from now on?

00:19:43.320 --> 00:19:44.980
Yeah, I don't think so.

00:19:44.980 --> 00:19:47.410
You think I'd go along with that?

00:19:47.410 --> 00:19:49.890
I thought that's what you'd say.

00:19:50.450 --> 00:19:51.830
In that case,

00:19:52.420 --> 00:19:54.240
it looks like I have 
no choice but to use my

00:19:54.240 --> 00:19:55.960
power to put you under my control.

00:19:56.570 --> 00:19:58.540
Stop it... please...

00:20:00.980 --> 00:20:03.540
Yes, just like this...

00:20:03.950 --> 00:20:05.340
Stop it!

00:20:07.480 --> 00:20:12.230
This is the only way I can live, 
just like my brother says.

00:20:12.970 --> 00:20:16.070
For that is the destiny of 
those who carry Noya blood.

00:20:16.420 --> 00:20:18.610
Don't... touch me!

00:20:20.610 --> 00:20:22.900
If you had pheromones 
directly inserted into you,

00:20:22.900 --> 00:20:24.750
I wonder what would happen...

00:20:25.450 --> 00:20:26.890
Just like this...

00:20:27.410 --> 00:20:28.790
No!

00:20:29.820 --> 00:20:30.830
Izumiko...

00:20:31.570 --> 00:20:34.580
Stop it, Itsuki-sama!

00:20:35.110 --> 00:20:37.850
Are you giving me an order, Izumiko?

00:20:37.850 --> 00:20:39.720
No, I just...

00:20:39.720 --> 00:20:41.290
Or only now have you changed

00:20:41.290 --> 00:20:43.590
your mind about wanting 
to save your sister?

00:20:43.930 --> 00:20:47.260
No, I... I...

00:20:50.100 --> 00:20:52.220
I just...

00:20:58.690 --> 00:21:00.230
Itsuki-sama, I...

00:21:03.430 --> 00:21:05.890
I am your maid, Itsuki-sama.

00:21:05.890 --> 00:21:08.780
You should only need me as your maid.

00:21:09.110 --> 00:21:13.330
I won't let you make other 
women your servants!

00:21:19.050 --> 00:21:20.250
<i>Izumiko?</i>

00:21:21.150 --> 00:21:22.350
<i>Izumiko...</i>

00:21:26.830 --> 00:21:29.180
Only I know,

00:21:29.700 --> 00:21:32.250
you've been the one hurting the most

00:21:32.250 --> 00:21:33.700
this whole time, right?

00:21:34.090 --> 00:21:37.210
You've been born having 
to bear this destiny...

00:21:38.920 --> 00:21:41.070
I feel very sorry for you, 
Itsuki-sama...

00:21:41.320 --> 00:21:43.040
Izumi... ko...

00:21:43.710 --> 00:21:45.140
Izumiko-san!

00:21:51.070 --> 00:21:52.240
I...

00:21:53.450 --> 00:21:55.570
I can't forgive myself

00:21:55.570 --> 00:21:58.170
for making her cry, for hurting her.

00:21:59.930 --> 00:22:03.720
What's happening to me...

00:22:05.000 --> 00:22:07.800
Itsuki-sama, what's wrong?

00:22:11.740 --> 00:22:16.140
I had promised myself never 
to hurt you, and now I...

00:22:19.010 --> 00:22:21.360
I'm sorry, Izumiko.

00:22:35.940 --> 00:22:36.790
A dream?

00:22:37.300 --> 00:22:39.360
Yes, your dream.

00:22:39.830 --> 00:22:41.880
I want my dream to be...

00:22:41.880 --> 00:22:43.170
Where Vice-President Ooba,

00:22:43.170 --> 00:22:45.930
Hiromatsu, Kanamori, Oomori-sensei,

00:22:45.930 --> 00:22:51.560
Neko-sensei, President Iseda, 
and Izumiko and Noya,

00:22:51.560 --> 00:22:55.130
all can have fun together 
in my club, forever.

00:22:55.970 --> 00:22:59.290
That's my dream.

00:24:30.760 --> 00:24:33.570
Hi there, would you like to 
ride along with the wind?

00:24:33.570 --> 00:24:34.200
Simple Fixed-gear Bike

00:24:33.570 --> 00:24:35.660
Footwork, network, teamwork!

00:24:34.200 --> 00:24:34.870
A Headlight That Cuts Through the Night

00:24:34.870 --> 00:24:35.660
"Fun, Different Colors"

00:24:35.660 --> 00:24:37.280
Cycling's elegant!

00:24:36.320 --> 00:24:37.280
Don't forget to wear a helmet!

00:24:37.280 --> 00:24:40.960
Riding through a neighborhood near you: 
Ebiten Bicycle

00:24:37.850 --> 00:25:00.000
Next time: "Beautiful Dreamers" Look forward to it!

00:24:38.100 --> 00:25:00.000
<b><i>Ebiten Bicycle</i></b>
